<figure class="cache-figure" data-stale-refresh>
 <p class="figure-title">Refresh early enough to keep a usable answer</p>
 <p class="figure-note">Fresh window: age below 10 s. Stale allowed during refresh: age 10–20 s. At age 20 s, stop serving the copy. Source changes from £12 to £15 at time 5 s.</p>
 <div class="refresh-age"><div><span>Fresh</span></div><div><span>Stale allowed</span></div><div><span>Too old</span></div><i data-marker></i></div>
 <div class="refresh-age-labels"><span>Age 0 s</span><span>10 s</span><span>20 s</span><span>30 s+</span></div>
 <div class="cache-copy-pair"><div class="cache-copy"><small>Saved observation</small><strong data-value>£12</strong><small data-age>Age 0 s</small></div><div class="cache-copy"><small>Latest read</small><strong class="refresh-reply" data-reply>No request yet</strong></div></div>
 <p class="figure-note">Time: <b data-now>0 s</b> · refresh: <b data-running>idle</b> · source attempts: <b data-attempts>0</b></p>
 <div class="cache-controls"><button data-action="advance">Advance 5 seconds</button><button data-action="read">Read price</button><button data-action="success">Finish refresh</button><button data-action="failure">Fail refresh</button><button data-action="timeout">End waiting request</button><button data-reset>Reset</button></div>
 <p class="explanation" data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p>
 <figcaption>Advance twice, read twice, then finish or fail the refresh. Only one refresh runs at a time. Failure adds five seconds of retry backoff and never renews the old copy’s age. At the hard limit a read waits; End waiting request represents its deadline. This does not cancel the shared load. Times are illustrative, not recommended settings.</figcaption>
</figure>
<script>
import {refreshInitial,refreshStep,refreshPhase} from '../../lib/caching/stampedes.mjs';
document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-stale-refresh]').forEach(root=>{let state=refreshInitial();const set=(n:string,v:string)=>{root.querySelector(`[data-${n}]`)!.textContent=v;};const render=()=>{const age=state.now-state.cached.observed;set('value',`£${state.cached.value}`);set('age',`Age ${age} s · ${refreshPhase(state)==='expired'?'cannot serve':refreshPhase(state)}`);set('reply',state.reply);set('now',`${state.now} s`);set('running',state.refresh?`loading observation from ${state.refresh.observed} s`:'idle');set('attempts',String(state.attempts));set('explanation',state.message);root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-marker]')!.style.left=`${Math.min(30,age)/30*100}%`;root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action="timeout"]')!.disabled=!state.waiting;for(const action of ['success','failure'])root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>(`[data-action="${action}"]`)!.disabled=!state.refresh;};root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-action]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state=refreshStep(state,b.dataset.action!);render();});root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-reset]')!.onclick=()=>{state=refreshInitial();render();};render();});
</script>
